{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2.5D Shooter with a unique minimalist cartoony style and a quirky story. Enjoy the thrill and simplicity of a 2D shooter with 3D graphics and 3D view. I opted for a somewhat relaxing gameplay to give users a quick and pleasant experience as some other Shmups I played do feel too perfectionists and inaccessible to most players.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot and avoid being shot at!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 - 10 Levels (Still haven't made up my mind)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story and dialogue displayed in-game. Will be added to right side where it can be read during gameplay. Gameplay will be somewhat easy enabling you to read and play. Also once skilled reading the story will be second nature.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well It's a shmup! An easy one! Later I will add more details as I complete this!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More info will be released as the game nears its completion.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3915580?t=1758269163","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915580/2d18d7aba69096ed49aeb42bf33c8b297dcd497a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758269163","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915580/b7fed673b7a2ea814b47072fa6335335134ac966/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758269163","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915580/b7fed673b7a2ea814b47072fa6335335134ac966/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758269163","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controll